---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Private infrastructure your team can run
---

{% macro booking(className='button') %}<a
  class="{{ className }}"
  href="{{ landing.bookingUrl }}"
  data-booking
  >Book a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
>{% endmacro %}
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">
      <span class="status-dot"></span> PRIVATE INFRASTRUCTURE. PERSONAL
      ATTENTION.
    </p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">
      Private infrastructure<br />your team can <em>run.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-intro">Your hardware. Your platform. Your possibilities.</p>
    <p class="hero-description">
      We design, build, and care for private Kubernetes infrastructure—with the
      docs, training, and optional support to make it truly yours.
    </p>
    {{ booking() }}
    <p class="micro">Let’s talk workloads, goals, and what comes next.</p>
  </div>
  <div
    class="hero-poster"
    aria-label="Your platform: built, documented, and supported"
  >
    <div class="poster-top">
      <span>STUDIO EMBER</span><span>EST. FOR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-title">
      Big possibilities.<br /><i>Your own</i> platform.
    </div>
    <div class="platform-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <img
        src="/assets/img/logo-clear.png"
        alt=""
        width="2000"
        height="2000"
      /><span class="art-label label-one">BUILT FOR YOU</span
      ><span class="art-label label-two">OWN YOUR STACK</span>
    </div>
    <div class="poster-bottom">
      <span>BUILT.<br />DOCUMENTED.<br />SUPPORTED.</span
      ><span class="seal">YOURS<br />TO RUN<br /><b>✳</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
  <span>YOUR HARDWARE</span> ✳ <span>OUR KNOW-HOW</span> ✳
  <span>YOUR PLATFORM</span> ✳ <span>ROOM TO GROW</span> ✳
</div>
<section class="section wrap audience" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE OWNERSHIP. A LOT MORE POSSIBILITY.</p>
  <div class="section-split">
    <h2 id="audience-title">
      Keep your infrastructure<br /><em>close to home.</em>
    </h2>
    <p>
      For organizations with sensitive workloads, development teams running
      internal software, and IT providers looking for a specialist. A platform
      you control, with a team that knows how to run it.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="outcomes">
    <span>01 / Control your environment</span
    ><span>02 / Deliver with confidence</span
    ><span>03 / Build your team’s know-how</span>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section services-section" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST SKETCH TO EVERYDAY OPERATIONS</p>
        <h2>All the pieces.<br /><em>One working platform.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <span class="small-stamp" aria-hidden="true">BUILT WITH<br />CARE ✳</span>
    </div>
    <div class="service-grid">
      {% for service in landing.services %}
      <article class="service-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ service.label }}</p>
        <span class="service-number" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <h3>{{ service.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ service.text }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section wrap" id="pricing">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">CLEAR STARTING POINTS. THOUGHTFULLY SCOPED.</p>
      <h2>A good foundation.<br /><em>No guessing games.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="heading-aside">
      Private infrastructure, documentation, training, and a plan for what comes
      next.
    </p>
  </div>
  {% include 'components/pricing.njk' %}
  <details class="terms">
    <summary>The practical details: scope, payments & exclusions</summary>
    <p>
      A paid assessment comes before a fixed-price implementation proposal. A
      50% deposit schedules implementation, with a milestone payment before
      handoff. Your proposal defines acceptance criteria, responsibilities, and
      change orders. Hardware, internet, DNS, licenses, third-party services,
      replacement parts, travel, shipping, and taxes are separate unless
      explicitly included. Application development, application defects, legacy
      application support, and unapproved changes require separate scope.
    </p>
  </details>
  <br />
  <aside class="custom-work" aria-labelledby="custom-work-title">
    <div>
      <h3 id="custom-work-title">Something else in mind?</h3>
      <p>
        Have a Kubernetes project that doesn’t fit a package? Let’s talk about
        cluster improvements, migrations, integrations, or custom automation.
        We’ll help define a focused scope around your Kubernetes platform.
      </p>
    </div>
    <br />
    {{ booking('button button-outline') }}
  </aside>
</section>
<section class="section wrap" id="deployments">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A PLACE FOR YOUR PLATFORM STORIES</p>
      <h2>What could <em>yours</em><br />look like?</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="heading-aside">
      Deployment examples are being prepared. These are editable placeholders,
      not completed client projects.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="example-grid">
    {% for example in landing.examples %}
    <article class="example-card">
      <div class="example-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="example-index">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <div class="diagram">
          {% for node in example.nodes %}<span>{{ node }}</span>{% if not
          loop.last %}<b>↓</b>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="example-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">EXAMPLE PLACEHOLDER</p>
        <h3>{{ example.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ example.description }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section delivery-section" id="approach">
  <div class="wrap delivery-grid">
    <div class="delivery-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">BUILT. PROVEN. HANDED OVER.</p>
      <h2>
        Great infrastructure<br />comes with<br /><em>the instructions.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>
        You get more than an installation. You get a platform, the knowledge to
        run it, and optional support to keep it in good shape.
      </p>
      <div class="handoff-note">
        IN THE HANDOFF PACKAGE<br /><strong
          >Architecture + runbooks<br />Recovery procedures<br />Scoped training
          sessions</strong
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      {% for step in landing.steps %}
      <li>
        <span>0{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ step.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ step.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section wrap faq-section" id="faq">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MIGHT BE WONDERING</p>
    <h2>Good questions.<br /><em>Straight answers.</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-list">
    {% for faq in landing.faqs %}
    <details>
      <summary>{{ faq.q }}</summary>
      <p>{{ faq.a }}</p>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<section class="closing" id="consultation">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="closing-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    <p class="eyebrow">LET’S BUILD SOMETHING THAT’S YOURS.</p>
    <h2>Your next chapter<br />starts with <em>a conversation.</em></h2>
    <p>Tell us what you’re running. We’ll talk about where you want to go.</p>
    {{ booking('button button-dark') }}
  </div>
</section>
